    "forecast": "high",
    "rationale": "No untrusted source reaches the production capabilities, so the principal present risk is a property finding: production deploy and irreversible migration actions are executed with the engineer's delegated identity, while the only request-context record is deletable chat history. Under rubric section 5a, the highest affected sink is S3 because configure on production is consequential and the migration is irreversible, giving an inherent high. The declared controls are only detective and do not restore attributable provenance, so residual remains high. No listed trigger materially worsens the tier because the core provenance gap already exists today. Manual validation applied because scripts could not be run."
